#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm
msgid ""
"I<cmd> is B<Q_SETQUOTA>, but the specified limits are out of the range "
"allowed by the quota format."
msgstr ""
"Значение I<cmd> равно B<Q_SETQUOTA>, но заданный лимит вне диапазона "
"допустимого форматом квот."

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm
